<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    
</head>
<body>

    <div class="container py-5">

        <div class="intro-section mb-5">
            <h2 class="text-center" style="color: #004080; font-weight: bold;">Candidates of Punjab</h2>
            <p class="text-center" style="color: #333; font-size: 16px;">
                Punjab, being the largest province of Pakistan, hosts a large number of candidates who are competing for positions in the provincial assembly (MPA) and national assembly (MNA). Below are the candidates from various regions of Punjab.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="candidate-boxes row row-cols-1 row-cols-md-3 row-cols-lg-4 g-4 mb-5">
            <div class="col">
                <div class="candidate-card">
                    
                    <img src="/images/ahsan iqbal.png" alt="Candidate 1" class="candidate-img">
                    <div class="candidate-info">
                        <h5>Mr. Ahsan Iqbal</h5>
                        <p>MPA Candidate</p>
                        <p>Party: PML-N</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col">
                <div class="candidate-card">
                    <img src="~/images/faryal-talpur.jpeg" alt="Candidate 2" class="candidate-img">
